              },
              "content": "让我看看……{A灵光一现}\n咩错咩错，是这个玩偶！\n<style=SizeSmall>居然一点都咩有浸湿？</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_202300801_1318775713_content",
                "value": "让我看看……{A灵光一现}\n咩错咩错，是这个玩偶！\n<style=SizeSmall>居然一点都咩有浸湿？</style>",
